				<text><![CDATA[                         This clearance is hereby granted on the condition that the requirements and fire prevention precautions provided for under Chapter 4,Division 17 of the RIRR of RA 9514 shall be strictly comply by the Owner, Management, Permit Authorizing Individual, Hot Work Operator,Contractor and Fire Watch before, during and after the welding, cutting and other hot work operations.]]></text>
